\par 2- Ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd h\'e0ng n\'e3m cho c\'e1c d\u7921\'3f \'e1n (bao g\u7891\'3fm: v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ghi n\'e3m k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch; v\u7889\'3fn ch\'fda s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng h\u7871\'3ft n\'e3
m b\'e1o c\'e1o; v\u7889\'3fn thu n\u7907\'3f vay) \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'e2n \'f0\u7889\'3fi trong NSTW v\'e0 ph\'e2n b\u7893\'3f theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch cho c\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn d\u7921\'3f \'e1n qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 
