; c\'e1c b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean ng\'e0nh). B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t v\'e0 cho vay th\'f4ng qua h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par 3- C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o d\u7921\'3f \'e1n \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft, c\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f d\u7921\'3f \'e1n \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn, qu\u7843\'3f}{
