\par Ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn d\u7921\'3f \'e1n l\'e0 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f d\u7921\'3f \'e1n:
