\f0\fs28\cf17\cgrid0\insrsid5400566\charrsid13573531 \u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cf17\cgrid0\insrsid5400566\charrsid13573531 n l\'fd d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cf17\cgrid0\insrsid5400566\charrsid13573531 \u7921\'3f \'e1n l\'e0 U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f.
\par - D\u7921\'3f \'e1n do c\'e1c ng\'e0nh Trung \'fd\'f5ng qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cf17\cgrid0\insrsid5400566\charrsid13573531 n l\'fd th\'ec ch}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
