\par 4- H\'e0ng n\'e3m c\'e1c c\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn d\u7921\'3f \'e1n ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc Th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 
