\par - Chi ph\'ed l\'e0m \'f0\'ea, c\u7889\'3fng, m\'fd\'f5ng c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng l\'f4 thu\u7897\'3fc v\'f9ng d\u7921\'3f \'e1n nu\'f4i tr\u7891\'3fng thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn.
\par 3.2 \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng cho vay l\'e0 ch\u7911\'3f d\u7921\'3f \'e1n; Tu\u7923\'3f theo t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft, \'f0\u7863\'3fc \'f0i\u7875\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng d\u7921\'3f \'e1n: Ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp nh
