\par 1.2- \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi v\u7889\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t v\'e0 cho vay \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd XDCB (v\u7889\'3fn trong n\'fd\u7899\'3fc) cho c\'e1c d\u7921\'3f \'e1n c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c B\u7897\'3f v\'e0 c\'e1c \'d0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng, B
