\par - C\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f d\u7921\'3f \'e1n c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd XDCB th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan Kho bac Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp v\u7889\'3fn.
\par - Chi c\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd XDCB th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h
\'e0ng n\'e3m c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c d\u7921\'3f \'e1n tr\'ean \'f0\u7883\'3fa b\'e0n g\u7917\'3fi c\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7891\'3fng g\u7917\'3fi c\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn d\u7921\'3f \'e1n \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph
\'fd\'f5ng.
\par h\'e0ng n\'e3m C\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd XDCB c\'e1c d\u7921\'3f \'e1n ( Trung \'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 \'f0\u7883\'3f
a ph\'fd\'f5ng) b\'e1o c\'e1o B\u7897\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft.
\par - C\'e1c \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng nh\u7853\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cf17\cgrid0\insrsid5400566\charrsid13573531 n l\'fd c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cf17\cgrid0\insrsid5400566\charrsid13573531 \u7879\'3fm quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n h\'e0ng n\'e3m v\u7899\'3fi B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par - h\'e0ng n\'e3m, c\'e1c chi c\u7909\'3fc di d\'e2n ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn v\'f9ng kinh t\u7871\'3f m\u7899\'3fi, chi c\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7883\'3fnh canh \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\'fd c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7889\'3fn s\u7921\'3f
 nghi\u7879\'3fp kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi C\u7909\'3fc di d\'e2n ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fnv\'f9ng kinh t\u7871\'3f m\u7899\'3fi v\'e0 c\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7883\'3fnh canh \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\'fd.  C\u7909\'3fc di d\'e2n ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn v\'f9
ng kinh t\u7871\'3f m\u7899\'3fi v\'e0 c\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7883\'3fnh canh \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\'fd c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7889\'3fn s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.

\par - Vi\u7879\'3fc quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd XDCB (c\'e1c c\'f4ng tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cf17\cgrid0\insrsid5400566\charrsid13573531 \'ecnh) ho\'e0n th\'e0nh v\'e0 quy}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cf17\cgrid0\insrsid5400566\charrsid13573531 \u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd khi k\u7871\'3ft th\'fac d\u7921\'3f  \'e1n , th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd s\u7889
\'3f  28 TC/\'d0T ng\'e0y 10/5/1991 c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2070\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13573531 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 
